# Enterprise (never commit here)
panorama-enterprise/

# Restore-drill artefacts — keep report.json + drift.json +
# chain-verify JSON summary (small + non-PII), but NEVER commit the
# raw source.dump (full tenant DB export) or the verbose pg_*.log
# files (may include PII row values on error). See
# docs/runbooks/restore.md §"Recording the drill artefact".
docs/audits/restore-drill-*/source.dump
docs/audits/restore-drill-*/dump.log
docs/audits/restore-drill-*/restore.log
docs/audits/restore-drill-*/reapply-migrations.log
docs/audits/restore-drill-*/prerestore-bootstrap.log
